      <div class="flex items-center gap-8 mx-4">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-400"><i data-lucide="zap" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> LIMITED DROP: UP TO 55% OFF SITEWIDE</span>
        <span class="text-slate-400">•</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-400"><i data-lucide="truck" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> FREE EXPRESS SHIPPING ON ALL ORDERS TODAY</span>
        <span class="text-slate-400">•</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sky-400"><i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> 7-DAY ZERO HASSLE REPLACEMENT GUARANTEE</span>
        <span class="text-slate-400">•</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-indigo-400"><i data-lucide="badge-check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> 100% VERIFIED CASH ON DELIVERY (COD) ACROSS INDIA</span>
